Subject: dialog-v2: the body is the one scroller under a fixed header

What: the dialog content clips (overflow hidden, no hidden-scrollbar rules) and the body
scrolls (min-height 0, overflow auto, overscroll contained).
Why: the content never overflowed while the body clipped, so a dialog taller than its
maximum height cut off its last fields and actions (Edit project's Save).

